save has_talked_once = 0

Oh!
if has_talked_once < 1
    A Shadowtail!
    You mean we did not all fail!?
    Collect 3 artifacts and I can transfer my remaining life essence to you.
    Would you like to learn more?
else
    Would you like to learn more?
set has_talked_once = 1
- Learn about Artifacts
    - Artifact 1
        It's a tea kettle from before the Dartmunks turned on us.
    - Artifact 2
        It's a water spout from the Ancients who built this place.
    - Artifact 3
        It's a fancy cushion that the rat king sat on before he was dethroned.
- Learn about Ghosts
    - Ghost of the West (Me!)
        I'm great!
    - Ghost of the East
        He needs to drink some tea and calm down...
    - Ghost of the Entrance
        My mentor. A sad death.
- No
    Maybe next time, pardner!
